div></div></div>\n          \n          <div class=\"v2s-meslot\" id=\"v2Me\"><button class=\"v2s-me\" id=\"v2Avatar\" type=\"button\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"v2AvatarMenu\"><span class=\"v2s-av\" aria-hidden=\"true\">AM</span><span class=\"v2s-me-t\"><b>Alex Morgan</b><small>Member</small></span><svg class=\"v2i v2s-me-c\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"/v3/theatre/icons.svg#chevrons-up-down\"></use></svg></button></div>\n        </footer>\n        <!-- THE DOCUMENTS THAT GOVERN THIS PRODUCT (WS11-T02) are in Settings › Legal & security only, one per line (the owner,\n             2026-10-13: not under the account button). The same list is in admin.html; interface/tests/run.mjs holds the two to one\n             set of links, each to a page that exists in Landing/site/. -->\n      </aside>\n      <!-- The sidebar's right edge: drag it (or use the arrow keys) to widen it, up to half again its default width. -->\n      <div class=\"lib-resize\" id=\"libResize\" role=\"separator\" aria-orientation=\"vertical\" aria-controls=\"library\" aria-label=\"Sidebar width\" aria-valuemin=\"240\" aria-valuemax=\"360\" aria-valuenow=\"240\"></div>\n      <!-- The shade behind the sidebar drawer: a tap on the page beside it closes it. Never shown while it is docked. -->\n      \n\n      <!-- THE ONE TOP BAR: breadcrumbs, the page's actions, the Inbox bell and + New - for the app's pages and the Docs pages. -->\n      <header class=\"v2-top\" id=\"v2Top\" data-v2-shell=\"1\">\n        \n        <nav class=\"v2t-crumbs\" id=\"v2Crumbs\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a href=\"#\">Contracts</a><span class=\"v2t-sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"v2i\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"/v3/theatre/icons.svg#chevron-right\"></use></svg></span><a href=\"#\">Master Services Agreement</a><span class=\"v2t-sep\" a