alse\" type=\"button\">\n                <span class=\"sc-label\">Low</span><span class=\"sc-num\">3</span>\n              </button>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"vf-conf-f vf-segw\">\n            <span class=\"vf-seg-k\" id=\"vfConfK\">Confidence</span>\n            <div class=\"vf-seg\" role=\"radiogroup\" aria-labelledby=\"vfConfK\">\n            <button class=\"vf-seg-b is-on\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"true\" data-vf-conf=\"all\" type=\"button\">Any<span class=\"vf-n\">9</span></button><button class=\"vf-seg-b\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-vf-conf=\"confident\" type=\"button\">Confident<span class=\"vf-n\">5</span></button><button class=\"vf-seg-b\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-vf-conf=\"not_confident\" type=\"button\">Not confident<span class=\"vf-n\">4</span></button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"vf-for vf-segw\">\n            <span class=\"vf-seg-k\" id=\"vfForK\">Your side</span>\n            <div class=\"vf-seg\" role=\"radiogroup\" aria-labelledby=\"vfForK\">\n            <button class=\"vf-seg-b\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-vf-for=\"Brightmoor Analytics Ltd\" type=\"button\"><span>Supplier</span><span class=\"vf-n\">7</span></button><button class=\"vf-seg-b\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-vf-for=\"Eastgate Savings Bank\" type=\"button\"><span>Bank</span><span class=\"vf-n\">9</span></button>\n            <button class=\"vf-seg-b is-on\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"true\" data-vf-for=\"\" type=\"button\" data-tip=\"Show every finding without taking a side.\">Neither<span class=\"vf-n\">9</span></button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"search vf-search\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"></circle><path d=\"M16 16 21 21\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg>\n            <input id=\"detectSearch\" type=\"search\" aria-label=\"Search findings\" placeholder=\"Search findings &amp; clauses…\" value=\"\" style=\"\">\n            \n          </div>\n          <div class=\"detect-triage\">\n            \n            \n            \n            <span class=\"vf-view\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Layout\">\n              <button class=\"vf-view-b is-on\" data-vf-view=\"split\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Split</button>\n              <button class=\"vf-view-b\" data-vf-view=\"inline\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Inline</button>\n            </span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        \n        \n\n        <div id=\"wcBannerHost\"></div>\n\n        \n        <div id=\"stageGapHost\"></div>\n\n        <div id=\"issuesGridWrap\" class=\"vf-body is-split\" style=\"position:relative;\"><div id=\"sxLoomHost\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:1060px;margin:0 auto\"><div class=\"detect-runtime v2-loom is-inline is-live\" data-ml-keep=\"\" data-phase=\"reading\" data-step=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Analysis progress\" data-ambient=\"running\"><div class=\"lm-side\"><div class=\"lm-head\"><svg class=\"lm-mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M45.99 10.61L0.76 91.88L35.45 71.76Z\"></path><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M50 0L55.82 72.89L50 100L44.18 72.89Z\"></path><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M54.01 10.61L64.55 71.76L99.24 91.88Z\"></path></svg><div class=\"lm-title\"><b class=\"lm-name\">Analysing Master Services Agreement</b><span class=\"lm-stage\">Read the terms…</span></div><span class=\"lm-pct mono\" aria-hidden=\"true\">0%</span></div><div class=\"lm-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Analysis progress\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" aria-valuenow=\"0\"><span class=\"lm-fill\" style=\"transform: scaleX(0.01);\"></span></div><ol class=\"lm-ladder\"><li class=\"lm-step is-now\" data-step=\"read\" data-i=\"0\" aria-current=\"step\"><span class=\"lm-tick sfx-on\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"sfx-place-orb\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><canvas class=\"sfx-orb\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 22px; height: 22px;\" data-sx-canvas-empty=\"1\"></canvas></span></span><span class=\"lm-step-l\">Read the terms</span></li><li class=\"lm-step\" data-step=\"rules\" data-i=\"1\"><span class=\"lm-tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"lm-step-l\">Build the rules</span></li><li class=\"lm-step\" data-step=\"check\" data-i=\"2\"><span class=\"lm-tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"lm-step-l\">Check every clause</span></li><li class=\"lm-step\" data-step=\"play\" data-i=\"3\"><span class=\"lm-tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"lm-step-l\">Play it out</span></li><li class=\"lm-step\" data-step=\"weigh\" data-i=\"4\"><span class=\"lm-tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"lm-step-l\">Weigh what's at stake</span></li><li class=\"lm-step\" data-step=\"write\" data-i=\"5\"><span class=\"lm-tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"lm-step-l\">Write it up</span></li></ol><div class=\"dr-story\"><div class=\"dr-msg\"></div></div><div class=\"lm-eta\"><span class=\"lm-elapsed\">elapsed 0:01</span><span class=\"lm-left\">under 8 min left</span></div><div class=\"lm-foot\"><span class=\"lm-bg\">It keeps running in the background — you can leave this page.</span><span class=\"lm-acts\"><button class=\"lm-notify\" type=\"button\" data-run-notify=\"\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-tip=\"You’ll get it in your Inbox here.\">Notify me when it’s done</button></span></div></div><div class=\"dr-map\"><div class=\"dr-doc\"><div class=\"dr-sec\" data-sec=\"s0\" data-unit=\"\" style=\"--i:0\"><span class=\"dr-sec-fill\"></span><span class=\"dr-sec-name\">Definitions</span><span class=\"dr-sec-label\">1</span></div><div class=\"dr-sec\" data-sec=\"s1\" data-unit=\"\" style=\"--i:1\"><span class=\"dr-sec-fill\"></span><span class=\"dr-sec-name\">Services</span><span class=\"dr-sec-label\">2</span></div><div class=\"dr-sec\" data-sec=\"s2\" data-unit=\"\" style=\"--i:2\"><span class=\"dr-sec-fill\"></span><span class=\"dr-sec-name\">Delivery and acceptance</span><span class=\"dr-sec-label\">3</span></div><div class=\"dr-sec\" data-sec=\"s3\" data-unit=\"\" style=\"--i:3\"><span class=\"dr-sec-fill\"></span><span class=\"dr-sec-name\">Fees and payment</span><span class=\"dr-sec-label\">4</span></div><div class=\"dr-sec\" data-sec=\"s4\" data-unit=\"\" style=\"--i:4\"><span class=\"dr-sec-fill\"></span><span class=\"dr-sec-name\">Change control</span><span class=\"dr-sec-label\">5</span></div><div class=\"dr-sec\" data-sec=\"s5\" data-unit=\"\" style=\"--i:5\"><span class=\"dr-sec-fill\"></span><span class=\"dr-sec-name\">Confidentiality</span><span class=\"dr-sec-label\">6</span></div><div class=\"dr-sec\" data-sec=\"s6\" data-unit=\"\" style=\"--i:6\"><span class=\"dr-sec-fill\"></span><span class=\"dr-sec-name\">Term and termination</span><span class=\"dr-sec-label\">7</span></div><div class=\"dr-sec\" data-sec=\"s7\" data-unit=\"\" style=\"--i:7\"><span class=\"dr-sec-fill\"></span><span class=\"dr-sec-name\">Liability</span><span class=\"dr-sec-label\">8</span></div><div class=\"dr-sec\" data-sec=\"s8\" data-unit=\"\" style=\"--i:8\"><span class=\"dr-sec-fill\"></span><span class=\"dr-sec-name\">Intellectual property</span><span class=\"dr-sec-label\">9</span></div><div class=\"dr-sec\" data-sec=\"s9\" data-unit=\"\" style=\"--i:9\"><span class=\"dr-sec-fill\"></span><span class=\"dr-sec-name\">General</span><span class=\"dr-sec-label\">10</span></div><div class=\"dr-sec\" data-sec=\"s10\" data-unit=\"\" style=\"--i:10\"><span class=\"dr-sec-fill\"></span><span class=\"dr-sec-name\">Schedule 1</span><span class=\"dr-sec-label\">11</span></div><div class=\"dr-sec\" data-sec=\"s11\" data-unit=\"\" style=\"--i:11\"><span class=\"dr-sec-fill\"></span><span class=\"dr-sec-name\">Schedule 2</span><span class=\"dr-sec-label\">12</span></div><div class=\"dr-sec\" data-sec=\"s12\" data-unit=\"\" style=\"--i:12\"><span class=\"dr-sec-fill\"></span><span class=\"dr-sec-name\">Execution</span><span class=\"dr-sec-label\">13</span></div><div class=\"dr-markers\"></div></div></div></div></div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n      </main>\n\n      <!-- Docs: the account's documents, deadlines and counterparties (clm.js), drawn in the same place as the app's pages, under the\n           same sidebar and top bar. Its menus, sheets, tips and toasts are inside it, so its styles (.dx) reach them. Its own side nav\n           and top bar are retired (the shell's are the Docs pages' too); the elements stay, empty, for older code that looks them up. -->\n      \n\n      <!-- The phone's bottom tab bar (coarse pointers, narrow screens): Home, Contracts, Inbox, Ask, Menu. -->\n      \n\n      <!-- Modal / palette / toast / popover hosts -->\n      <div class=\"modal-root\" id=\"modalRoot\"></div>\n      <div class=\"palette-root\" id=\"paletteRoot\"></div>\n      <div class=\"popover-root\" id=\"popoverRoot\"></div>\n      <div class=\"toast-root\" id=\"toastRoot\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-label=\"Notifications\"></div>\n      <div class=\"toast-root toast-root--top\" id=\"toastRootTop\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-label=\"Notifications\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Dedicated full-screen sign-in / create-account page. Gates the whole\n         app; shown until a session exists, brought back on logout. -->\n    <!-- v2 (area brand): on the reader's theme (theme-boot stamps body[data-theme]; v2/auth.css carries the screen's own\n         palette per theme), the three-blade mark, and the lattice mark on ONE canvas (v2/auth.js): it assembles once and\n         stops; the SVG mark on phones and without a canvas. Motion is always on: no Pause button. -->\n    \n\n    <!-- Forced password change. Raised when the session's credential was\n         issued by an administrator: the server answers every other route with\n         403 \"password change required\" until it is replaced, so this gate has\n         no close control and Sign out is its only other action. -->\n    \n\n    <!-- Language pack + runtime load FIRST: i18n.js installs its observer before\n         any renderer runs, so the very first paint is already in the stored\n         language and nothing flashes English on the way. -->\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    <!-- The motion and render layer (window.SentinelMotion) on Motion v14 (vendor/motion.js, MIT): after the language\n         layer, whose originals its morph compares against, and before every script that renders. -->\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    <!-- The original document, as uploaded, beside the parse (Draft: Original / Side by side). The Word renderer it needs\n         (vendor/docx-preview.min.js, vendor/jszip.min.js) is loaded only when a Word file is shown. -->\n    \n    <!-- Files, as an explorer: the account's folders (backend/drive.py) and the documents filed in them. -->\n    \n    <!-- The Detect run's progress QUEUE and its state machine: the timing\n         rules that turn a cached re-run's bursts into a readable sequence,\n         kept out of app.js so a fake clock can drive them in the tests. -->\n    \n    <!-- v2 redesign modules (interface/v2/): loaded before clm.js and app.js, which call them. -->\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    <!-- the Insights agent (its box, its widgets, the To-do list, \"Make this a rule\"): before parsed-view draws a toolbar and the\n         Insights pages mount it -->\n    \n    <!-- a document's versions (the header's chip, the Versions panel, a clause's history), its change list and the Word export\n         window: before clm.js and app.js, which draw them -->\n    \n    \n    <!-- the paper's measures and words, and the print page's preparation the window's preview shares (v2/paper.js, v2/docprint.js):\n         before the export window, which reads them -->\n    \n    \n    \n    <!-- Home's horizon: the voice-glow port (MIT, v2/LICENSE-voice-glow.txt), laid along the band's foot by home.js -->\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    <!-- the Insights pages (#/insights...): after pages.js, whose kit they use, and before clm.js, which draws them -->\n    \n    <!-- the review workspace (#/insights/<id>): after insight.js, whose kit it is built with; its evidence pane after it -->\n    \n    \n    <!-- setting up a review and changing it in place: the pieces both use (the documents table, the rules with switches, Read as), the\n         header's lens that changes a review where it stands, and the composer in two panes - after the workspace, whose lens they fill -->\n    \n    \n    \n    <!-- the workspace's views over its stand-ins - the Table, the Documents, the Requests - and the Export panel (E): after the\n         workspace, whose registry they register in, and its pane, whose pure parts the Table's card uses -->\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    <!-- Ask or tell (#/insights...): after the workspace, whose registry it plugs into, and before the Askbot, whose Ctrl+/ it takes on\n         these pages -->\n    \n    <!-- Insights, Prepare (#/insights/prepare, #/insights/rooms/<rid>): after pages.js, whose page kit and crumbs it builds on, before\n         clm.js, which draws it -->\n    \n    <!-- deals (the owner's decision 5: a label grouping reviews, rooms and to-dos) and their picker, then Insights Home by deal (#/insights,\n         routed from v2/insight.js): after insight.js, whose kit they use, before clm.js, which draws them -->\n    \n    \n    \n    <!-- Help (#/help, #/welcome) and the tour's API: after pages.js, whose page kit it uses, before clm.js, which draws it and asks the\n         tour when it is due. The player (demo.js, demo-kit.js, help-plays.js, demo.css) is loaded by it on first use. -->\n    \n    <!-- Docs, a page of the app: loaded before app.js, drawn only when the app shows it (SentinelDocs.enter). -->\n    \n    \n    <!-- Askbot's face (v2/fx-bot.js, bot-avatars of libraries.dev): before the Askbot, which wears it -->\n    \n    <!-- the Askbot (SNT-158): after the app, which it asks who is signed in and what is open -->\n    \n      <!-- where the two effects go, on every page (v2/fx-places.js): last, so every page it watches is up -->\n    \n\n\n<section class=\"v2ab is-shut\" aria-label=\"Askbot\" style=\"left: 1372px; top: 770px; width: 46px; height: 46px;\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"v2ab-icon\" data-ab=\"icon\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-keyshortcuts=\"Control+/\" aria-label=\"Askbot\"><span class=\"v2ab-float\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" data-sx-canvas=\"1\" class=\"ba\" style=\"display: block; flex: 0 0 auto; width: 78px; height: 78px; margin: -18.2px -13px -7.8px; opacity: 1; transition: opacity 0.3s ease-out; pointer-events: none;;width:78px;height:78px\"></span></button></section>","html_attrs":{"data-motion":"full","data-lang":"en"},"html_class":"ml-vt-capable","body_class":"","body_attrs":{"data-theme":"midnight"},"body_style":"background: rgb(11, 13, 18);"}